<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co. Ltd (ABHICL) — FY24 Financial Data Extraction
## Year Ended 31 March 2024

## Research Note: Sourcing Limitations Encountered

A comprehensive attempt was made to retrieve FY24 statutory financials directly from the requested source and related IRDAI public-disclosure documents. The findings are summarized below:

- The `adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials` URL **does not host any financial statements**. It returns only site navigation and footer content — no P&L, Balance Sheet, or NL-forms are present. <doc_source>step10web1</doc_source>
- The only IRDAI "NL" public-disclosure PDF discoverable at `healthinsurance/assets/pdf/public-disclosure.pdf` is a **stale filing for the quarter ended 31 December 2016** — roughly nine years out of scope for FY24, and therefore cannot be used per the "no mixing periods" requirement. <doc_source>step10web1</doc_source>
- No FY24-specific NL-1 (Revenue Account), NL-2 (Expenses Schedule), NL-30 (Analytical Ratios), or NL-33 (Solvency) disclosure for the quarter ended 31 March 2024 could be located on ABHICL's domain. Unlike its life-insurance sister entity — which maintains a persistent quarterly archive at `lifeinsurance.adityabirlacapital.com/about-us/public-disclosure/` — ABHICL does not appear to publish an indexed, by-quarter disclosure archive at this URL path.
- ABHICL's standalone annual report is not separately listed on the company site; its results are disclosed only within **Aditya Birla Capital Ltd's (the listed parent) consolidated results and press releases**, which report segment-level, not full statutory-entity, figures.
- Fragmentary secondary data surfaced via news search pertains to **H1 FY25 / Q2 FY25**, not full-year FY24, and per the task's rules cannot substitute for FY24 figures:
  - GWP of ₹1,130 cr relates to Q2 FY25, not FY24 <doc_source>step39web2</doc_source>
  - A combined ratio of 119% relates to H1 FY24 only — a half-year figure, not the full year <doc_source>step39web2</doc_source>
  - A 12.6% market-share figure appears in an FY25-context interview, not FY24 <doc_source>step39web1</doc_source>

Per the explicit instruction to **leave a value blank rather than estimate or default to zero** when a figure is genuinely not published, no full-year FY24 statutory (IGAAP) or IFRS-basis figures for ABHICL could be verified from an authoritative, period-correct, full-year source within the accessible document set.

## Data Table

Because no numeric values, filing dates, or unit-attached figures could be verified for any line item, the `value` and `filing_date` columns contained no retrievable data and have been omitted below. The table reflects line-item scope, basis, and unit specification, along with sourcing status for each item.

